  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VERIFICATION OF EXPENDITURE OF SERVICE CONTRACT FOR THE EUROPEAN UNION N&#xba; FOOD(2017)390-060 GFA / CRIS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: VERIFICATION OF EXPENDITURE OF SERVICE CONTRACT FOR THE EUROPEAN UNION N&#xba; FOOD(2017)390-060 GFA / CRIS - The proposed Action will provide the necessary support for the sound implementation of the Global Challenges (People) Thematic Programme (and ancestor programmes), the achievement of its expected objectives and results, and the measurement, analysis and reporting on its impact. This action will cover expenditure associated with the programme implementation in HQ and EU Delegations, including projects preparation, monitoring, evaluation and audit, and related activities such as sector policy analysis and dialogue. The action will also support communication actions designed to raise awareness, understanding and support for the EU&#xbf;s priorities on Human Development and Migration</narrative>
  </description>
